{
  "case_id": "BUG2-EMPOWER-DECAY-1.21.1",
  "title": "bug2 赋能应每 0:30 递减一层(含 0:30 规格常量核验)",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "bugfix",
    "ref": "bug2"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "步骤1 基线清零,并读取生产代码里的递减间隔常量(应 600 tick)"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe empowerclear B2"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe decayinterval B2"
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "步骤2 叠 5 层赋能(应同时把递减计时器重新起算为 600 tick)"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe empower 5 B2"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe status B2"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "步骤3 把递减计时器置为「已到期」,驱动链(PlayerTickEvents 每 20 tick → EmpowerManager.tick → EmpowerEffect.consumeOne)应在 ≤1 秒内真实减 1 层—— 无需真的等 30 秒"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe decaydue B2"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe status B2D"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B2_DECAY_INTERVAL:600"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B2_EMPOWER_STEP:read:5"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B2_EMPOWER:5:6\\d\\d"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B2D_EMPOWER:4:\\d+"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B2_ERR|AP_B2_EX|AP_B2D_ERR|AP_B2D_EX"
    },
    {
      "type": "kubejs"
    },
    {
      "type": "crash"
    }
  ],
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running"
}
